      55.05,
      418.5,
      295.07,
      471.66
    ],
    "text": "I, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReformation, hereby declare under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, that the lands described below is neededfor a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions ofthat Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
